{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nI am settled here in Amsterdam, having arrived shortly after noon. I went straight to Dr. Besseling’s, where Mr. van Ghert’s recommendation opened the door. It is a house of order, which I appreciate after the chaos of travel.\n\nI spent the afternoon in the picture gallery. I confess I was struck dumb before a Rembrandt—fifteen to twenty feet across, twelve high. It is not mere decoration; it is the spirit of the age made visible, the individual soul expanded into the universal. I did not finish the collection, but I have seen enough to know that art here speaks the language of freedom we have only begun to articulate in our own land.\n\nThe light in the evening is distinct, grey and clear. I miss the warmth of your hearth and the noise of the boys. Write soon.\n\nYour G. W. F."}}],"created":1795080103,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":188,"prompt_tokens":938,"total_tokens":1126,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-13msq7uxvmV9VPsyXWR1AGjqm9nbdJwk","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":938,"prompt_ms":920.403,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.9812398720682303,"prompt_per_second":1019.1187990478084,"predicted_n":188,"predicted_ms":4506.092,"predicted_per_token_ms":24.096748663101604,"predicted_per_second":41.499374624397376}}